<title>FINLAND: GWS SELLS HALF OF PERLOS TO SWEDISH INVESTMENT CO.</title>
<headline>GWS SELLS HALF OF PERLOS TO SWEDISH INVESTMENT CO.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish privately onwed Oy G.W. Sohlberg Ab (GWS) said in a statement on Thursday it had agreed to transfer its GWS Perlos Oy business to a new company to be jointly owned with Swedish Scandinavian Equity Partners (SEP).</p>
<p>SEP is a private equity investment company established in 1994 by Investor, SE-Banken and AEA Investors as an extention of the Wallenberg industrial tradition, GWS said.</p>
<p>&quot;It is possible that Perlos will be listed on a stock exchange in the future,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>SEP acquires medium-sized firms in the Nordic countries, adding expertise on top of capital, GWS said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0245</p>
</text>
